			description: [
				"&aConnecting across the dimensions&r requires a bigger antenna than just one &bAetheric Beacon&r. To accomplish this you'll need to build... a square! &6Build this 3x3 structure&r, called an &bAetheric Bridge&r, consisting of 8 &bAetheric Rings&r surrounding 1 &bAetheric Chamber&r and &6connect it to your &bNexus&r &6using a cable&r. It can be &astanding upright&r, like in the image below, or &aflat on the ground&r!"
				""
